      "content": "That helps. One more thing—I've seen these types of events suffer from those tiny, annoying issues that are hard to predict. Like a random cable malfunction, a lost badge, or a sudden technical glitch that just seems to happen out of nowhere for no reason. How should we prepare for those kinds of little, pesky disruptions that tend to pop up during live events?",
